# Force LF line endings for all text files regardless of a checkout's local
# core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows checkout with the common
# `core.autocrlf=true` default silently rewrites every text file (including
# scripts/check_no_egress.sh's shell-script inputs and its own
# infra/egress_allowlist.txt) to CRLF, which breaks that script's regex
# matching against every allowlist rule at once -- a false result the script
# gives no indication of, discovered while verifying this change locally on
# Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
